## OpenVSA data artefacts
#
# IQ recordings are routinely multi-gigabyte (REQ-REC-008 segments at 2 GB by default) and
# must never enter git history. Golden recordings for CI live in an artefact store, not here
# (REQ-TST-005).
*.ovsa
*.binf
*.sdf
*.cap
*.pcap
*.pcapng
recordings/
captures/

